#
# LTP "syscalls" scenario-group skip list (kirk --skip-file).  One test tag per line;
# lines beginning with '#' and blank lines are ignored.  See fs.skip for the
# policy.
#
# The syscalls group is large and many cases are unrelated to a network
# filesystem (IPC, scheduling, namespaces, device nodes, local-fs-only syscalls)
# or require privileges/features NFS does not expose; expect a substantial list
# here.  Seeded from a memfs baseline run; add an entry with a one-line reason.
